i did a movie  called megaforce  a lot of you haven't heard of it it was  a very interesting movie  when you say interesting as a producer  it means it didn't make any money  but  it was the movie was we were not  nominated by the academy that year they  were looking for something a little more  substantial  but the whole conceit behind the movie  the idea was a group of uh um rangers  who moved in these uh dune buggies at  very high speeds uh and and on the top  of the dune bodies with these massive  missiles that they launched in the  attack plan  well  the first step was to design these  missiles  hal  had a man he held with helen built the  land speed world speed record car that  smashed all records in bonneville and he  got his mechanic who designed the car to  design the rockets for megaforce  and then he called me one day said  bill's bringing with the rockets on the  lot and he wants to show it to us  i said okay we're on the goldwyn line  we called uh the head of security  and they sent a guard with bill  and his truck out to the back of the lot  when i got to the back of the lot i saw  this missile i almost fainted it was  about a thousand feet  long it looked like one of those  missiles you see on the news when the  russians are having the may day parades  you know this huge god damn  bill said like put these to your planet  and when i count to three you press the  button i was waiting to see what color  the smoke was coming out the back  so it went three two one i pressed the  button  the goddamn thing took off it went right  over the truck into the middle of the  gold one line i looked at database oh my  god we just got to kill people we must  have murdered people there's missiles  flying through the lot of cold one  we go running we go running down the lot  looking in this thing  as it came around the  corner is the new sound stage stage 10.  the number one was six feet tall  and the zero was six feet tall but in  the middle of the zero was a huge hole